  "prefLabel": "Ins 7001.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 7001.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to implement the provisions of RSA 415:5, III and RSA 415-A to standardize and simplify the terms and coverages of individual non-renewable short term limited duration health insurance policies that provide medical, hospital, and major medical expense benefits for a specified term.\n\nSource. #12798, eff 6-10-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins7000.html"
